, "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 673325585, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 458041676, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "yellow   network links + chain          red     startup + config (main.rs, bot_settings.rs)\ngreen    ingest: Step 1 listen, Step 2 decode          blue    Step 3 in-memory state\npink     Steps 4 + 5 swap math and best size          white   Step 6 decide, build, send\n\nSafety net: leg 2 minimum out = start amount + every cost + MIN_PROFIT.  If prices move, the chain reverts the whole tx.\nSafe by default: no wallet = watch only;  SEND_TRANSACTIONS=false = build + sign, never send.", "originalText": "yellow   network links + chain          red     startup + config (main.rs, bot_settings.rs)\ngreen    ingest: Step 1 listen, Step 2 decode          blue    Step 3 in-memory state\npink     Steps 4 + 5 swap math and best size          white   Step 6 decide, build, send\n\nSafety net: leg 2 minimum out = start amount + every cost + MIN_PROFIT.  If prices move, the chain reverts the whole tx.\nSafe by default: no wallet = watch only;  SEND_TRANSACTIONS=false = build + sign, never send.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 5, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"theme": "light", "viewBackgroundColor": "#121212", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}